1
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:07,380
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,130 --> 00:00:11,330
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:16,060
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:21,220
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:25,210
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:28,460
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,210 --> 00:00:33,730
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:37,690
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:40,690
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:45,060
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,810 --> 00:00:48,050
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:50,900
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,670 --> 00:00:54,250
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:57,420
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,170 --> 00:01:00,500
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,410 --> 00:01:03,380
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,130 --> 00:01:06,820
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,650 --> 00:01:19,260
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,170 --> 00:01:22,340
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,250 --> 00:01:25,460
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,330 --> 00:01:28,420
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,170 --> 00:01:33,060
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:43,690
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:50,150 --> 00:01:52,590
Since you destroyed my Demon Tower...

25
00:01:52,670 --> 00:01:53,990
I will...

26
00:01:53,910 --> 00:01:56,830
make you pay a hundredfold !

27
00:02:00,310 --> 00:02:02,400
1 hour ago

28
00:02:00,750 --> 00:02:02,990
I can't dodge his Divine Sense attack.

29
00:02:03,750 --> 00:02:06,200
Even if the Celestial Ascension Fruits ignited my killing intent,

30
00:02:06,030 --> 00:02:07,790
their effect is fading.

31
00:02:08,030 --> 00:02:10,510
If I don't severely injure the entity in the black tower,

32
00:02:10,710 --> 00:02:11,870
I'm sure

33
00:02:12,110 --> 00:02:13,590
that I will die.

34
00:02:14,350 --> 00:02:15,910
Then I have to risk it !

35
00:02:16,670 --> 00:02:18,520
Tell me how to use the Blood Soul Pill

36
00:02:18,270 --> 00:02:20,030
in exchange for a chance of survival.

37
00:02:20,350 --> 00:02:21,710
If you don't,

38
00:02:21,910 --> 00:02:24,480
I'll crush my bag of holding before I die

39
00:02:24,230 --> 00:02:26,390
to collapse this space

40
00:02:26,350 --> 00:02:28,480
and trap you in the void forever.

41
00:02:36,990 --> 00:02:38,150
Damn it,

42
00:02:38,670 --> 00:02:39,990
it's you !

43
00:02:40,190 --> 00:02:40,950
Explode !

44
00:03:14,750 --> 00:03:16,310
The backlash of the Celestial Ascension Fruits

45
00:03:16,070 --> 00:03:18,680
is more severe than I imagined...

46
00:03:19,950 --> 00:03:21,790
Even if the black tower was destroyed,

47
00:03:21,950 --> 00:03:24,160
his Origin Soul is still alive.

48
00:03:24,110 --> 00:03:26,960
Only the Ancient Demon will be able to seal him.

49
00:03:27,310 --> 00:03:29,630
I must return to the Sky Demon Country.

50
00:03:40,070 --> 00:03:43,310
He's... still alive ?

51
00:04:03,310 --> 00:04:05,630
Countless years of accumulated energy,

52
00:04:05,590 --> 00:04:08,470
Master's resurrection,

53
00:04:08,710 --> 00:04:11,910
you ruined it all...

54
00:04:12,150 --> 00:04:14,720
Wang Lin !

55
00:04:19,670 --> 00:04:22,920
Some remnants of the fruits are left in my Origin Soul,

56
00:04:22,790 --> 00:04:25,150
I'll be able to use them to block Divine Sense attacks.

57
00:04:25,350 --> 00:04:27,750
There was no enmity between us

58
00:04:27,590 --> 00:04:29,190
but he still attacked me.

59
00:04:29,350 --> 00:04:31,270
As expected, there is no right or wrong

60
00:04:31,310 --> 00:04:32,670
in this cultivation world,

61
00:04:32,830 --> 00:04:34,710
only strength prevails.

62
00:04:36,110 --> 00:04:39,520
Outskirts
of Sky Demon City

63
00:04:36,270 --> 00:04:39,160
Although our promise from 10 years ago was delayed because of my breakthrough,

64
00:04:38,950 --> 00:04:40,710
this matter was extremely important.

65
00:04:40,910 --> 00:04:43,680
I doubt the Ancient Demon will go back on his word.

66
00:04:54,470 --> 00:04:56,790
Wang Lin !

67
00:04:56,710 --> 00:04:57,990
Ling Tianhou ?

68
00:04:58,590 --> 00:04:59,550
No...

69
00:04:59,750 --> 00:05:01,590
This person only looks like him,

70
00:05:01,630 --> 00:05:03,310
his aura is completely different.

71
00:05:03,750 --> 00:05:05,430
Something weird is going on here.

72
00:05:06,510 --> 00:05:08,790
Perhaps I can use this to buy some time.

73
00:05:18,550 --> 00:05:21,070
Ling Tianhou is Da Lou Sword Sect Leader,

74
00:05:20,870 --> 00:05:22,830
how did you obtain his body !?

75
00:05:32,390 --> 00:05:34,630
You're courting death !

76
00:05:37,670 --> 00:05:39,510
Teleporting takes too much time,

77
00:05:39,950 --> 00:05:41,550
I'll have to blast my way through.

78
00:05:51,230 --> 00:05:52,590
Senior Ancient Demon,

79
00:05:52,430 --> 00:05:54,390
how long do you intend to watch !?

80
00:05:54,230 --> 00:05:55,230
You...

81
00:05:55,230 --> 00:05:57,870
are going to die !

82
00:06:15,150 --> 00:06:17,310
You're 10 years late

83
00:06:17,190 --> 00:06:19,390
and still dare to order me around ?

84
00:06:19,750 --> 00:06:21,310
I beg Senior for help.

85
00:06:21,510 --> 00:06:22,630
Bei Luo,

86
00:06:22,830 --> 00:06:24,870
stay out of this !

87
00:06:24,750 --> 00:06:26,190
This is my territory,

88
00:06:26,430 --> 00:06:29,070
you have no right to order me.

89
00:06:31,510 --> 00:06:33,110
Lend me your blood.

90
00:06:42,470 --> 00:06:43,990
Bei Luo...

91
00:06:44,150 --> 00:06:46,670
Do you dare to stop me ?

92
00:06:58,110 --> 00:07:01,000
I would've stopped if the Ancient Devil had come.

93
00:07:02,350 --> 00:07:05,990
But you are just one of the nine Scattered Devils of the Ancient Devil.

94
00:07:06,030 --> 00:07:08,070
Who do you think you are !?

95
00:07:07,950 --> 00:07:08,830
Senior,

96
00:07:08,910 --> 00:07:09,790
10 years ago...

97
00:07:09,550 --> 00:07:10,390
Shut up !

98
00:07:10,750 --> 00:07:12,190
Heal yourself.

99
00:08:07,550 --> 00:08:08,870
Their spells

100
00:08:08,990 --> 00:08:11,590
are somewhat similar to Ancient God spells.

101
00:08:14,670 --> 00:08:19,070
The Ancient Demon, Ancient Devil, and Ancient God clans

102
00:08:18,990 --> 00:08:21,590
all originate from the Ancient Order.

103
00:08:21,870 --> 00:08:25,710
This is an opportunity for you to comprehend their Dao.

104
00:08:25,870 --> 00:08:27,230
Watch carefully.

105
00:08:36,790 --> 00:08:40,230
Ancient Gods are neither Demon nor Devil.

106
00:08:40,750 --> 00:08:44,310
In their palms lies the power to shatter space.

107
00:08:54,630 --> 00:08:57,320
This fight between the Ancient Demon and the Scattered Devil

108
00:08:57,070 --> 00:08:59,790
has allowed me to understand some Ancient God spells.

109
00:09:00,150 --> 00:09:02,160
The benefits for my original body

110
00:09:01,950 --> 00:09:03,310
are inestimable.

111
00:09:04,430 --> 00:09:06,760
3 days later

112
00:09:14,990 --> 00:09:16,590
I finally finished refining

113
00:09:16,750 --> 00:09:18,790
the 4 drops of Celestial Wine.

114
00:09:19,630 --> 00:09:22,240
But this fight between the Ancient Demon and the Scattered Devil

115
00:09:22,030 --> 00:09:23,790
is very strange.

116
00:09:25,350 --> 00:09:27,720
The Ancient Demon seems to be hitting lethal strikes each time

117
00:09:27,470 --> 00:09:29,390
but in reality, he's holding back.

118
00:09:30,150 --> 00:09:31,310
Could he...

119
00:09:31,630 --> 00:09:33,110
be showing him mercy ?

120
00:09:33,350 --> 00:09:34,350
Bei Luo,

121
00:09:34,390 --> 00:09:36,950
is fighting me to the death over an ant

122
00:09:36,950 --> 00:09:38,390
worth it ?

123
00:09:39,470 --> 00:09:40,910
I don't need

124
00:09:41,430 --> 00:09:43,590
to explain to you why I do it.

125
00:09:44,030 --> 00:09:45,990
You fool !

126
00:09:46,070 --> 00:09:48,630
Master won't let you off !

127
00:09:49,750 --> 00:09:51,910
So he is wary of the Ancient Devil.

128
00:09:52,390 --> 00:09:54,310
But if this mad dog escapes,

129
00:09:54,310 --> 00:09:56,790
he'll likely come back for me to the ends of the world.

130
00:09:57,750 --> 00:10:00,160
Since there's no way to resolve this matter peacefully anymore,

131
00:09:59,910 --> 00:10:01,430
I must act thoroughly.

132
00:10:06,910 --> 00:10:08,270
Billion-Soul Flag

133
00:10:08,710 --> 00:10:10,230
enter the Underworld River !

134
00:10:16,230 --> 00:10:17,270
Xu Liguo !

135
00:10:20,830 --> 00:10:21,830
Th...This is...

136
00:10:22,670 --> 00:10:24,390
M...Master...

137
00:10:26,390 --> 00:10:28,390
If I can help Master slay this Devil,

138
00:10:28,670 --> 00:10:29,790
it's worth it !

139
00:10:31,230 --> 00:10:32,680
Now...

140
00:10:32,830 --> 00:10:35,470
I'll play all my cards

141
00:10:35,750 --> 00:10:38,510
to eradicate your soul !

142
00:10:46,950 --> 00:10:48,910
Although I, Wang Lin, am weak,

143
00:10:49,430 --> 00:10:52,110
I'm not someone you can mess with !

144
00:11:09,870 --> 00:11:11,590
As long as you stay behind him,

145
00:11:11,750 --> 00:11:13,430
he'll have endless fuel.

146
00:11:17,830 --> 00:11:20,310
Yet, you dare to come to me yourself ?

147
00:11:20,430 --> 00:11:22,230
You're courting death !

148
00:11:31,230 --> 00:11:33,790
You nearly killed me before

149
00:11:34,190 --> 00:11:36,830
and forced me to flee for 3000 li !

150
00:11:38,150 --> 00:11:39,910
I will make you pay

151
00:11:40,750 --> 00:11:42,790
blood for blood !

152
00:11:45,830 --> 00:11:47,870
With your level of cultivation,

153
00:11:47,790 --> 00:11:49,990
what can you do to me !?

154
00:11:52,470 --> 00:11:53,270
This is...

155
00:11:53,510 --> 00:11:56,790
a chaotic power blending Divine Sense and his comprehension of the Dao  !

156
00:12:01,150 --> 00:12:03,190
My Divine Sense is unstable

157
00:12:03,030 --> 00:12:04,630
and I've lost the Demon Tower.

158
00:12:04,630 --> 00:12:06,400
I shouldn't fight any longer.

159
00:12:06,270 --> 00:12:07,990
Although my body was destroyed,

160
00:12:07,950 --> 00:12:09,990
I can always make a comeback

161
00:12:09,870 --> 00:12:12,190
as long as the armor remains.

162
00:12:12,430 --> 00:12:15,510
He knows he can't kill the Scattered Devil.

163
00:12:15,510 --> 00:12:17,390
What is he trying to do ?

164
00:12:17,430 --> 00:12:18,710
You won't

165
00:12:18,750 --> 00:12:20,270
be able to escape !

166
00:12:21,550 --> 00:12:23,270
Without the Celestial Ascension Fruits,

167
00:12:23,350 --> 00:12:26,110
you can't withstand even a wisp of my devil soul !

168
00:12:27,630 --> 00:12:29,230
Who told you

169
00:12:29,150 --> 00:12:31,070
that my Celestial Ascension Fruits

170
00:12:31,510 --> 00:12:33,510
are all used up ?

171
00:12:49,750 --> 00:12:52,270
Do you think you can fight me

172
00:12:52,230 --> 00:12:54,590
with your meager comprehension of the Dao !?

173
00:12:58,510 --> 00:13:00,190
It's just some remnants !

174
00:12:59,990 --> 00:13:02,190
So what if they blocked my devil soul once ?

175
00:13:02,470 --> 00:13:04,710
Since you're determined to die,

176
00:13:04,750 --> 00:13:06,110
then even if

177
00:13:06,030 --> 00:13:08,110
I have to sacrifice some of my cultivation,

178
00:13:07,870 --> 00:13:10,790
I will possess you for sure !

179
00:13:11,470 --> 00:13:13,630
The final move

180
00:13:14,390 --> 00:13:15,750
relies on

181
00:13:16,470 --> 00:13:19,790
me not being alone.

182
00:13:27,950 --> 00:13:29,670
Well played, Wang Lin.

183
00:13:29,910 --> 00:13:31,790
You used yourself as bait

184
00:13:31,590 --> 00:13:34,310
to trap the Scattered Devil within your Origin Soul

185
00:13:34,550 --> 00:13:36,310
and force me to intervene.

186
00:13:36,990 --> 00:13:38,590
If I help you,

187
00:13:38,350 --> 00:13:40,040
I will fulfill your wish.

188
00:13:39,910 --> 00:13:41,390
If I don't help you,

189
00:13:41,310 --> 00:13:43,510
these 3 days of fighting

190
00:13:43,790 --> 00:13:46,590
would've been in vain.

191
00:13:47,070 --> 00:13:49,630
Since you predicted I would help,

192
00:13:49,590 --> 00:13:52,110
then this is your good fortune.

193
00:13:55,230 --> 00:13:58,560
Cloud Sky Sect
Planet Suzaku

194
00:14:17,190 --> 00:14:18,750
Is he the one

195
00:14:18,750 --> 00:14:20,270
from that legend ?

196
00:14:22,550 --> 00:14:24,270
He entered the Celestial Realm,

197
00:14:24,430 --> 00:14:26,120
beat Red Butterfly,

198
00:14:26,230 --> 00:14:27,990
fought Qian Feng.

199
00:14:28,030 --> 00:14:29,790
All by himself,

200
00:14:29,870 --> 00:14:33,070
he shook the entire planet Suzaku.

201
00:14:32,950 --> 00:14:35,110
Then why didn't he become the Suzaku ?

202
00:14:34,950 --> 00:14:36,510
That's the highest position !

203
00:14:39,110 --> 00:14:40,710
His path

204
00:14:40,830 --> 00:14:43,430
lies beyond the sea of stars.

205
00:14:58,070 --> 00:14:59,390
The rain has stopped.

206
00:15:00,670 --> 00:15:04,790
May he protect our clan and grant us peace and prosperity.

207
00:15:05,590 --> 00:15:07,190
These candles

208
00:15:07,190 --> 00:15:10,190
are the lights we send for him.

209
00:15:10,790 --> 00:15:13,920
Wang Lin's
Sea of Consciousness

210
00:15:12,070 --> 00:15:13,680
After months of cultivating,

211
00:15:13,630 --> 00:15:16,000
I finally stabilized my Ascendant cultivation.

212
00:15:16,310 --> 00:15:18,910
I can't fully refine this Devil for now

213
00:15:19,070 --> 00:15:21,190
but I can already suppress him

214
00:15:21,430 --> 00:15:23,310
with the help of the Ancient Demon.

215
00:15:23,670 --> 00:15:25,230
When the time comes,

216
00:15:25,270 --> 00:15:27,590
I can refine him into my second Origin Soul.

217
00:15:29,150 --> 00:15:31,070
As for this demon armor...

218
00:15:34,750 --> 00:15:38,120
Dragon Pool
Sky Demon Country

219
00:15:42,830 --> 00:15:45,430
If I use the Demonic Finger with this armor,

220
00:15:45,870 --> 00:15:48,520
it would be even stronger than the Underworld River.

221
00:15:50,150 --> 00:15:51,390
Are you

222
00:15:51,670 --> 00:15:53,390
leaving already ?

223
00:15:59,470 --> 00:16:01,390
The Ancient Demon has helped me multiple times

224
00:16:01,350 --> 00:16:03,080
at a considerable cost.

225
00:16:03,430 --> 00:16:05,190
If I leave now,

226
00:16:05,750 --> 00:16:07,910
he'll think I'm abandoning him.

227
00:16:08,310 --> 00:16:09,910
Senior has helped me 3 times,

228
00:16:09,990 --> 00:16:11,670
I will remember it.

229
00:16:12,150 --> 00:16:13,520
The reason I'm leaving

230
00:16:13,270 --> 00:16:15,280
is precisely to fulfill our agreement.

231
00:16:15,190 --> 00:16:16,790
But before that,

232
00:16:16,910 --> 00:16:19,240
I would like to ask Senior's help with something.

233
00:16:19,470 --> 00:16:20,710
Speak...

234
00:16:21,910 --> 00:16:24,150
Can senior help me find an old friend ?

235
00:16:24,550 --> 00:16:26,750
His Divine Sense is on this pagoda.

236
00:16:34,230 --> 00:16:37,120
There's no such Sword Spirit in the Sky Demon Country.

237
00:16:37,070 --> 00:16:39,710
If you want me to search the entire Demon Spirit Land,

238
00:16:39,670 --> 00:16:42,470
you must first retrieve a Demon Spirit for me.

239
00:16:44,470 --> 00:16:45,390
Agreed.

240
00:16:48,550 --> 00:16:51,760
This person is definitely connected to Sword Saint Ling Tianhou.

241
00:16:51,950 --> 00:16:53,990
Keeping him could come in use later.

242
00:16:54,870 --> 00:16:55,990
Two more things.

243
00:16:56,070 --> 00:16:57,240
First,

244
00:16:56,990 --> 00:16:58,390
I want this person.

245
00:16:58,710 --> 00:16:59,740
Second,

246
00:16:59,510 --> 00:17:01,200
I want to enter the Ancient Demon inheritance

247
00:17:00,950 --> 00:17:02,390
to refine my spells.

248
00:17:04,190 --> 00:17:05,830
I can give you the person

249
00:17:05,830 --> 00:17:07,870
but for the Ancient Demon inheritance...

250
00:17:09,230 --> 00:17:10,600
If within 100 years,

251
00:17:10,670 --> 00:17:12,630
you can obtain a Demon Spirit,

252
00:17:12,790 --> 00:17:14,510
then we'll discuss it.

253
00:17:15,230 --> 00:17:16,280
Okay.

254
00:17:16,550 --> 00:17:18,190
But with just my strength,

255
00:17:18,070 --> 00:17:19,470
it will be difficult.

256
00:17:19,990 --> 00:17:21,390
From now on,

257
00:17:21,470 --> 00:17:23,670
you are my Sky Demon Envoy.

258
00:17:23,950 --> 00:17:25,870
Your identity is higher than the Demon Emperor.

259
00:17:26,510 --> 00:17:29,870
My Sky Demon Country will officially wage war to the Fire Demon Country.

260
00:17:30,430 --> 00:17:32,230
You will use this opportunity

261
00:17:32,310 --> 00:17:33,910
to approach the Fire Demon Spirit.

262
00:17:34,390 --> 00:17:35,710
I will fulfill my mission

263
00:17:35,830 --> 00:17:37,190
within 100 years.

264
00:17:41,160 --> 00:20:15,320
After the Blood Soul Pill absorbs a trace of Divine Sense and blood, it also activates another ability for a short period of time. At the moment of death, anything that is linked to the Origin Soul will be merged with the void. After one is resurrected, they can use the power of their soul and blood to retrieve the items stored in the void.

That small glimpse at planet Suzaku is a whole chapter in the novel where we learn that Zhou Ru has become some kind of princess of planet Suzaku and has reached Core Formation. She is protected by Chi Hu the new Patriarch of the Giant Demon Clan, Yunque Zi of the Forsaken Immortal Clan, Zhou Wutai the Suzaku and Little White the tiger.

265
00:18:02,190 --> 00:18:07,920
Ask

266
00:18:03,710 --> 00:18:05,760
Qi Condensation

267
00:18:04,630 --> 00:18:07,920
the perilous path filled with countless blades.

268
00:18:07,150 --> 00:18:09,040
Foundation Establishment

269
00:18:08,310 --> 00:18:14,720
Can the mundane world be shattered

270
00:18:09,670 --> 00:18:12,360
Core Formation

271
00:18:12,870 --> 00:18:15,800
Nascent Soul

272
00:18:11,110 --> 00:18:14,720
by a child's steadfast heart ?

273
00:18:14,590 --> 00:18:20,960
If the laws of this world

274
00:18:16,430 --> 00:18:19,240
